Method
Syntax
<Path>.setList(DialogItem:string, List:any) → boolean
Parameters
You can specify the following parameters:
• The parameter DialogItem of data type string designates a List Box, a Drop-down List Box, or a Tab
Control.
• The parameter List of data type any designates the one-columned list into which you enter the Items
