setPasswordMasking [SimTalk]
Sets if the check box Password of a dialog item of type Edit Text Box in the Dialog designated by <Path>
will be selected or cleared.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.setPasswordMasking(DialogItem:string, Selected:boolean) → boolean
Parameters
You can specify the following parameters:
• The parameter DialogItem of data type string designates the check box Password 
 .
• The parameter Selected of data type boolean sets if the check box Password will be selected (true) or
cleared (false).
When it is selected the Dialog shows text that the user enters into the text box with superscripted lower
case xes 
 . When it is cleared it shows the password as clear text 
 .
